{"unit_id":"ynymhrb__long-horizon-runtime#feature-1","repo":"ynymhrb/long-horizon-runtime","commit":"cf98c1c17f6d33fa81ff1f0e8ed999984499a1d7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Long Horizon Runtime 的功能「长任务规划」：把目标和约束生成可查看的任务计划；可选择自动执行，或先等待用户确认。通过 DSH 对话中的 long_task_create 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:90-109","src/runtime.ts:35-50"]}
{"unit_id":"ynymhrb__long-horizon-runtime#feature-2","repo":"ynymhrb/long-horizon-runtime","commit":"cf98c1c17f6d33fa81ff1f0e8ed999984499a1d7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Long Horizon Runtime 的功能「任务进度区」：在 DSH Web 会话中打开任务区和当前任务条，查看任务、步骤及状态摘要，并定位任务会话。通过会话标题操作或输入区任务条触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/index.js:23-30","src/task-ui.ts:14-28"]}
{"unit_id":"ynymhrb__long-horizon-runtime#feature-3","repo":"ynymhrb/long-horizon-runtime","commit":"cf98c1c17f6d33fa81ff1f0e8ed999984499a1d7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Long Horizon Runtime 的功能「暂停与恢复」：可暂停、继续、确认计划或取消长任务；恢复后后台执行。通过 long_task_update、long_task_confirm 或 long_task_resume 触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:116-130"]}
{"unit_id":"ynymhrb__long-horizon-runtime#feature-4","repo":"ynymhrb/long-horizon-runtime","commit":"cf98c1c17f6d33fa81ff1f0e8ed999984499a1d7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Long Horizon Runtime 的功能「查看事件」：按游标读取运行事件摘要，或列出执行尝试的子会话 ID，便于了解任务进展。通过 long_task_events 和 long_task_attempt_sessions 触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:131-139","src/task-api.ts:117-133"]}
{"unit_id":"ynymhrb__long-horizon-runtime#caveat-1","repo":"ynymhrb/long-horizon-runtime","commit":"cf98c1c17f6d33fa81ff1f0e8ed999984499a1d7","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Long Horizon Runtime 使用前须知：任务数据库和产物目录写入本机配置路径；安装配置默认将它们放在 DSH 家目录下的 long-task-runtime 目录。见 cordis.patch.yml:4-6。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:4-6"]}
